      "content": "A rigorous assessment focuses on consistency, adaptability, and emotional regulation under pressure. Look closely at how you transition between tasks, aiming for smooth pivots rather than abrupt shifts in focus. Observe your internal monologue when faced with minor setbacks, noting if your reaction is proportionate or overly reactive. High performers typically demonstrate proactive problem-solving rather than simply reacting to the inconvenience.",
